  "technique_references": [
    "Tapered capsule strokes painted with a z-buffer",
    "Per-blade hashing for direction, length and colour",
    "Clumped placement from low-frequency noise",
    "Petal stamps from a cosine of the polar angle",
    "Height to tangent-space normal by central differences"
